Add scaled FP8 support when importing.

ComfyUI's scaled FP8 checkpoints store an F32 weight_scale or scale_weight
beside each FP8 weight. The importer ignored it, so those weights came in
off by a factor of 1/scale. Applying the scale while decoding covers every
importer that reads safetensors.
